{"id": "zh-001", "category": "zh", "audio": "zh-001.wav", "duration": 10.38, "text": "“这并不是告别。这是一个篇章的结束，也是新篇章的开始。”", "entities": [], "source": "google/fleurs:cmn_hans_cn/test/10026684690566417990.wav", "license": "CC-BY-4.0"}
