{"id": "zh-015", "category": "zh", "audio": "zh-015.wav", "duration": 6.96, "text": "起初，他被送往位于大雅茅斯的詹姆斯·佩吉特医院进行救治。", "entities": [], "source": "google/fleurs:cmn_hans_cn/test/1015891181557233386.wav", "license": "CC-BY-4.0"}
{"id": "zh-016", "category": "zh", "audio": "zh-016.wav", "duration": 18.44, "text": "有些人认为他是对的，但也有很多人持相反意见；他们认为太阳系是围绕着地球运转的，太阳也是（甚至其他恒星也是）。", "entities": [], "source": "google/fleurs:cmn_hans_cn/test/1017060882143751441.wav", "license": "CC-BY-4.0"}
