{"id": "zh-037", "category": "zh", "audio": "zh-037.wav", "duration": 16.86, "text": "2002 年，戈马被尼拉贡戈火山的熔岩所摧毁。火山熔岩掩埋了该镇的大部分街道，尤其是镇中心。", "entities": [], "source": "google/fleurs:cmn_hans_cn/test/1065812790870009684.wav", "license": "CC-BY-4.0"}
